et exactly the area of the shape  that we want  this simplifies to be 12.5 pi minus 25  which is approximately equal to 14.27  and that's the answer  thanks for making us one of the best  communities on youtube  see you next episode of mind your  decisions where we solve the world's  problems  one video at a time  you
 

